# Files the Cursor agent must not read (secrets, personal data).
# Reads: guard-read.sh (Cursor) + permissions.deny in .agents/settings.json (Claude).
# Keep patterns in sync; .env.example is allowed (deny .env.* + allow Read(./.env.example) on Claude).
# (.cursorignore does NOT protect against terminal commands).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
tmp/
webapp_dbdata/
